---
intent: >
  Deprecate the `/aide:init` slash command. Delete the in-project command
  file `.claude/commands/aide/init.md` and rewrite the three `/aide:init`
  references in `.claude/commands/aide.md` (the `/aide` orchestrator) to
  point at `npx aidemd-mcp init` (cold-start) and `/aide:upgrade` (drift)
  as appropriate. The underlying `aide_init` MCP tool, its sub-helpers
  (`provisionBrain/`, `configureIde/`, `installAgents/`, etc.), and the
  inline-recovery flow inside the orchestrator stay exactly as they are.
---

## Project Structure

This plan governs only the `.claude/` harness — the in-project agent and
slash command surface. After execution, `.claude/commands/aide/init.md`
no longer exists, and `.claude/commands/aide.md` no longer references
`/aide:init`. Every other file in this scope is unchanged. Cross-scope
edits (the `scaffoldCommands` registry and spec body, the README,
JSDoc comments in `src/`, the cli's deferred-categories warning) are
explicitly out of scope here — see Decisions for the routing.

```
.claude/
├── .aide                                     ← intent spec (already updated; do not touch)
├── plan.aide                                 ← THIS plan (replaces the prior 9/9 plan)
├── todo.aide                                 ← prior QA artifact (already present; do not touch)
├── settings.local.json                       ← harness settings (do not touch)
├── commands/
│   ├── aide.md                               ← (MODIFY) /aide orchestrator — three `/aide:init` references
│   │                                           replaced per step 1: the `no-mcp-entry` branch (~line 36),
│   │                                           the failure fallback inside the inline-recovery flow
│   │                                           (~lines 76 and 80), and the non-empty-but-broken
│   │                                           `vaultPath` branch (~line 86)
│   └── aide/
│       ├── init.md                           ← (DELETE) wizard prompt for the deprecated /aide:init command
│       ├── align.md                          ← (unchanged)
│       ├── build.md                          ← (unchanged)
